      "content": "BOVINGDON              \tWHELPLEY HILL TL 00 SW \t\t\t\t\t(East side)                                         6/55 26.1.67                                       \tBarton Colyers                                  \t\t(formerly listed as                                        \t\tLittle Colyers) GV                                       \tII Farmhouse, now a private house. C17 or earlier, partly cased in red brick in C18. Timber frame infilled or cased in red brick. Steep old red tile roof, S half stepped up beyond chimney. A 2-storeys/2-storeys and attics house facing W with 2-storeys gabled front porch and small gabled timber porch added to shelter the entrance. Tall central chimney with (4-tall conjoined diagonal shafts. Lobby entrance plan. 3 windows long, with battened door in moulded surround in porch. Casement windows. N part has exposed close studded timber frame at 1st floor. Clasped purlin roof. Higher S half has attics. Listing NGR: TL0005503800"
    }
